-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
THIRD-PARTY CODE NOTICES
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository builds on the following third-party codebases:

1. MuSc (Zero-Shot Anomaly Detection via Mutual Scoring)
   Source : https://github.com/xrli-U/MuSc
   Paper  : Li et al., ICLR 2024
   License: MIT
   Modules used as-is: models/modules/_LNAMD.py, models/modules/_MSM.py,
            models/modules/_RsCIN.py, models/RsCIN_features/,
            examples/musc_main.py, datasets/, configs/, utils/

2. open_clip
   Source : https://github.com/mlfoundations/open_clip
   License: MIT
   Location: models/backbone/open_clip/

3. DINOv2
   Source : https://github.com/facebookresearch/dinov2
   License: Apache-2.0
   Location: models/backbone/dinov2/

4. Segment Anything Model (SAM)
   Source : https://github.com/facebookresearch/segment-anything
   License: Apache-2.0
   Usage  : models/sam_refiner.py (SAM1 backend, checkpoint not included)

5. SAM 3 (Sam3TrackerModel)
   Source : https://huggingface.co/facebook/sam3
   License: Apache-2.0
   Usage  : models/sam_refiner.py (SAM3 backend, weights downloaded at runtime)

6. PatchCore
   Source : https://github.com/amazon-science/patchcore-inspection
   License: Apache-2.0
   Usage  : Conceptual influence on feature extraction pipeline

EthMuSAM's original contributions (DINOv3 backbone integration and the
cascaded 3-pass SAM refinement stage) are released under CC BY-NC 4.0 above.
